money and money, money

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:38.224
and give them the
wrong incentives.

00:07:38.224 --> 00:07:39.992
So I don't know what to say.

00:07:39.992 --> 00:07:43.029
Maybe it's just I
have it in my DNA.

00:07:43.029 --> 00:07:44.897 align:start size:84% position:16%
And like I said,
you know, we lifted.

00:07:44.897 --> 00:07:46.799 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Have you been able to
sit down with any of them?

00:07:46.799 --> 00:07:48.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
For the record, I've
been telling all of them-

00:07:48.067 --> 00:07:49.302
- I have tried.

00:07:49.302 --> 00:07:50.970
- We tried to get
AOC here this week.

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:52.572 align:start size:97% position:3%
We tried to get Rashida Tlaib,
we tried to get Ilhan Omar.

00:07:52.572 --> 00:07:55.074 align:start size:97% position:3%
I mean, we tried for
everybody and nobody said yes.

00:07:55.074 --> 00:07:59.612 align:start position:0%
- Well, I have specifically
gone to talk to the Black Caucus

00:07:59.612 --> 00:08:02.148
because I wanted the
Black Caucus to help me

00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:07.153
defend the Afro-Cubans in
Cuba who are being beaten

00:08:08.354 --> 00:08:10.990
and brutalized by
the Cuban police.

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:12.391
- [Dave] Yeah.

00:08:12.391 --> 00:08:15.394 align:start size:97% position:3%
- When they go on the
streets and scream "Freedom."

00:08:15.394 --> 00:08:19.966
That has been my ask, help
me with the Afro-Cubans.

00:08:19.966 --> 00:08:24.070 align:start size:97% position:3%
We're not here to talk about
Cuba, the embargo, food.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:25.571
No, no, no.

00:08:25.571 --> 00:08:27.440
We're here to talk about
defending the Afro-Cubans.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.442
They are as Black as you are.

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.513 align:start size:81% position:19%
I need you to help
me defend them

00:08:33.513 --> 00:08:34.947
because they are
my constituents,

00:08:34.947 --> 00:08:37.583 align:start position:0%
or at least I have constituents
that are their relatives.

00:08:37.583 --> 00:08:38.818
But I don't get any response.

00:08:38.818 --> 00:08:40.286
- I guess you're
not getting, yeah.

00:08:40.286 --> 00:08:42.355
- I do not understand,
because if you come to me

00:08:42.355 --> 00:08:44.457
to something that
is so dear to me

00:08:44.457 --> 00:08:48.394 align:start size:97% position:3%
as defending African American,
African American rights

00:08:48.394 --> 00:08:50.363 align:start size:88% position:13%
and Black Lives
Matters, but, you know,

00:08:50.363 --> 00:08:53.966
Black lives matter
across the board.

00:08:53.966 --> 00:08:55.401
- [Dave] Yeah.

00:08:55.401 --> 00:08:58.204 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Not only in the United
States, in Latin America too.

00:08:58.204 --> 00:09:02.108 align:start size:97% position:3%
And you have the repressive
apparatus in Havana

00:09:02.108 --> 00:09:06.245 align:start size:88% position:13%
repressing those people
who are Afro-Cubans

00:09:06.245 --> 00:09:07.813 align:start size:84% position:16%
and who are
screaming and saying,

00:09:07.813 --> 00:09:08.648
(speaking in foreign language)

00:09:08.648 --> 00:09:10.116
"We want freedom."

00:09:10.116 --> 00:09:12.585 align:start size:84% position:16%
So why don't we have
the Black Caucus

00:09:12.585 --> 00:09:15.354 align:start size:84% position:16%
in the United
States helping them?

00:09:15.354 --> 00:09:16.789
I don't get it.

00:09:16.789 --> 00:09:18.991 align:start position:0%
- Well, I think it would expose
a lot of their hypocrisy-

00:09:18.991 --> 00:09:22.161 align:start size:97% position:3%
- And I went to them and I
went to three specific members

00:09:22.161 --> 00:09:23.329
and they're saying,

00:09:23.329 --> 00:09:24.130 align:start size:84% position:16%
"Yeah, yeah, we
wanna work with you."

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.064
Then let's do it.

00:09:25.898 --> 00:09:26.732
I'm waiting.

00:09:26.732 --> 00:09:27.667
- I'm here, yeah.

